# Copy to .env.local and adjust. Base URL of the Surfwinddate FastAPI backend.
# Root-relative media/image URLs from the API are resolved against this.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# CARTO basemap API key (free: https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey). All in-app
# maps use CARTO raster tiles; without a key CARTO watermarks them ("API KEY
# REQUIRED") under load. The key is normally read from the shared root .env as
# CARTO_API_KEY (see vite.config.ts); set VITE_CARTO_KEY here only to override
# it for the frontend build. On the deploy (Vercel), set CARTO_API_KEY (or
# VITE_CARTO_KEY) in the project env. Left empty everywhere = keyless.
# VITE_CARTO_KEY=
